  "code" : "public int floorSqrt(int n) {\n    long low = 0, high = n, ans = 0;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        long mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (mid * mid <= n) {\n            ans = mid;\n            low = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            high = mid - 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return (int) ans;\n}",
